{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35698","headline":"鸡鸣曲 · 李咸用","name":"鸡鸣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海树相扶乌影翘，戴红拍翠声胶胶。\n鸳瓦冻危金距趫，夸雄鬬气争相高。\n漏残雨急风萧萧，患乱忠臣欺宝刀。\n霜浓月薄星昭昭，太平才子能歌谣。\n山翁梦断出衡茅，谷口雾中饥虎号，离人枕上心忉忉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}